WEBVTT

27:07.450 --> 27:10.077
Buzz! Oh, Buzz!
Buzz Lightyear.

27:10.161 --> 27:12.496
Buzz Lightyear, thank goodness.
We've got trouble!

27:12.580 --> 27:15.249
-Trouble? Where?
-Down there. Just down there.

27:15.333 --> 27:18.085
A helpless toy, it's...
it's trapped, Buzz!

27:18.169 --> 27:20.587
Then we've no time to lose.

27:26.428 --> 27:27.553
I don't see anything!

27:27.637 --> 27:29.847
Oh, he's there!
Just, just keep looking!

27:29.931 --> 27:31.223
What kind of toy...
